hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke do aurtein thein jo ghar ya hujre mein chamda seeti thein. Phir un mein se ek nikli jabke us ki hatheli mein suja chubha tha. Phir us ne doosri par dawa kiya. Phir Ibn Abbas ke paas uthaya gaya. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar logon ko un ke dawon se diya jaye to qaum ke khoon aur maal chale jayein. Use Allah se yaad dilao, aur us par parho [beshak jo Allah ke ahad se khareedte hain]. Phir unhon ne use yaad dilaya aur us ne iqrar kiya. Phir Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qasam mudda'alaih par hai."
"1114","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne apne hujre ke darwaze par jhagda suna. Phir Aap un ke paas nikle. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun. Aur beshak mere paas hareef aata hai. Phir shayad tum mein se ek doosre se zyada baat karne wala ho. Phir main gumaan karun ke wo sacha hai aur us ke liye is ka faisla karun. Phir jis ke liye main ne musalman ke haq ka faisla kiya wo to Aag ka tukda hai. Phir use le ya chhore."
"1115","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hind bint Utba ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Sufyan kanjoos mard hai. Aur wo mujhe aur mere bete ko kafi nahi deta, siwaye jo main us se lun jabke wo nahi janta. To Aap ne farmaya: Lo jo tumhe aur tumhare bete ko maroof se kafi ho."
"1116","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hind bint Utba aayi. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Zameen ki peeth par khaime walon mein se koi mere nazdeek tumhare khaime walon ke zaleel hone se zyada mehboob na tha. Phir aaj zameen ki peeth par khaime walon mein se koi mere nazdeek tumhare khaime walon ke izzat pane se zyada mehboob nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Aur bhi, Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Sufyan rokne wala mard hai. To kya mujh par harj hai ke main us se khilaun jo us ka hai hamare ghar walon ko? Aap ne farmaya: Main use maroof ke siwa nahi dekhta."
"1117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira bin Shu'ba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tum par maon ki na-farmani, betiyon ko zinda dafan karna, rokna aur mangna haram farmaya. Aur tumhare liye qeel-o-qaal, kasrat se sawal aur maal zaya karna na-pasand farmaya."
"1118","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin al-Aas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Jab hakim faisla kare aur ijtihad kare phir durust ho to us ke liye do ajr hain. Aur jab faisla kare aur ijtihad kare phir khata kare to us ke liye ek ajr hai."
"1119","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne bete ko likha jo Sijistan mein tha: Ke do ke darmiyan faisla na karo jabke tum ghazab-naak ho. Kyunke main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Koi hakim do ke darmiyan faisla na kare jabke wo ghazab-naak ho."
"1120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo hamare is mamle mein wo nikale jo is mein nahi to wo radd hai."
"1121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Do aurtein thein jin ke sath un ke do bete they. Bhediya aaya aur un mein se ek ke bete ko le gaya. To us ki saheli ne kaha: Wo to tumhare bete ko le gaya. Aur doosri ne kaha: Wo to tumhare bete ko le gaya. Phir wo dono Dawud ke paas faisle ke liye gayein. To unhon ne badi ke liye faisla kiya. Phir wo dono Sulaiman bin Dawud ke paas niklein. Phir unhon ne unhe khabar di. To unhon ne farmaya: Mere paas chhuri lao, use un dono ke darmiyan cheer dun. Phir chhoti ne kaha: Aisa na karo. Allah tum par rehem farmaye. Wo us ka beta hai. Phir unhon ne chhoti ke liye faisla kiya."
"1122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ne ek shakhs se us ki zameen khareedi. Phir jis shakhs ne zameen khareedi us ne apni zameen mein ghada paya jis mein sona tha. Phir jis ne zameen khareedi us ne us se kaha: Mujh se apna sona lo. Beshak main ne tum se zameen khareedi hai aur tum se sona nahi khareeda. Aur jis ki zameen thi us ne kaha: Beshak main ne tumhe zameen aur jo us mein hai bechi. Phir wo dono ek shakhs ke paas faisle ke liye gaye. Phir jis ke paas wo faisle ke liye gaye us ne kaha: Kya tumhari aulad hai? Un mein se ek ne kaha: Mera ladka hai. Aur doosre ne kaha: Meri ladki hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ladke ka ladki se nikah karo. Aur apne aap par us mein se kharch karo aur sadqa karo."
